{"id":"wb-2-44","name":"常德铁幢","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"常德铁幢","text":"常德铁幢，位于中华人民共和国湖南省常德市滨湖公园内，是一座铁质的经幢。该幢始建于北宋年间，原位于乾明寺旁，1979年搬至公园。该经幢内部中空，高4.34米，塔身外有浮雕及铭文。1982年，常德铁幢被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B8%B8%E5%BE%B7%E9%93%81%E5%B9%A2","revisionId":85826710,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85826710","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c5b4f75fe8978cc0cf1a566f.jpg","title":"铁经幢北_20240228.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%93%81%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2%E5%8C%97_20240228.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/%E9%93%81%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2%E5%8C%97_20240228.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Uuongkinghe","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​铁经幢北面","width":320,"height":480}}